WEBVTT

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.400
Have you...

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.650
ever fallen...

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.030
in love?

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:58.840
Swaying Unbalance

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.270
Moving on, now for participants for the boys' cavalry battle.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.360
Does anyone want to do it?

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.110
I'll do it!

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.240
Kusuda, you do it.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.860
What?!

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.700
Propos-

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.620
Hey! Your voice is too loud!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.540
Arihara-san, Enomoto-san, please be quiet.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.580
Sorry!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.420
Gosh Ayumi, I got in trouble because of you.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:36.880
Sorry, I was so surprised, I...

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.340
I was shocked too...

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.840
I thought it was going to be just a regular date.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.520
This lobster is delicious!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.160
It's not my birthday yet...

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.370
I want you to marry me.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.040
Wha? Marriage?!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:18.090
That independent company that I founded two years ago is developing well.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.550
I cannot let you endure any future hardships.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.720
So, start a warm family with me.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.600
Kei-chan?

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.970
Marriage?!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:31.560
Excuse me, but I'm still 14!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.600
Cut the crap, you lolicon!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.150
Two years!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.730
I'll wait two years!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:45.410
Gosh, why should I have to marry some old guy who's over double my age?

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.830
Wait, why are you having dinner with some old guy in the first place?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:52.870
He was an acquaintance of my sister. I'm not sure why, but he asked me out to dinner.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.920
But being proposed to sounds lovely.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.340
I want to be proposed to, too!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.130
We need four people for the cavalry battle though.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:05.510
I've already told you that it's just a nuisance if it's from someone you don't like.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.470
Didn't we have this conversation already the other day?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.100
Yeah, it was about what we would do if we were confessed to.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:17.320
That's when Enomoto said that looks are important.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:21.940
But, still, even if he does have a nice face, a proposal coming from a lolicon is a bit... Right?

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.200
Yeah!

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.410
Isn't there a guy with both nice looks and personality somewhere?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.700
What is it Eonomoto?

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.250
Don't stare at me so long because I'm just that handsome.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.790
It's embarrassing!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:43.260
Nope. Lolicon old men are bad, but someone who misunderstands is even worse!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.760
Kei-chan, I'm sure you'll find someone soon. You're pretty popular after all.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.970
That's right!

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.890
Earlier today, your shoe locker was stuffed with love letters.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.600
You never know what kind of people wrote those love letters!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.770
I would hate it if they were from someone like Beast-kun.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.070
Why can't I just meet the perfect man?

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.570
Enomoto, it's because your standards are too high.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:09.740
There's no one who's good looking, tall, has a good personality, and rich to top it all off.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:14.160
But someone like that definitely fits my tastes.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.750
You said that right, you wrinkly-faced middle schooler.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.170
Hey, who's the wrinkly-faced middle schooler?!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.210
Just call it mature. Mature!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.340
Well then, that's it for the boys' cavalry battle.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.470
Next it the girls' 100 meter dash.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.140
Yes, I nominate Dobashi-san.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.890
W-Wait, Enomoto!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.230
It's because you're fast, Dobashi.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.400
So fast that you were scouted by the track team.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.690
That's right.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:39.730
Isn't that fine?

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.650
Agreed!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.860
W-Wait a sec.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.730
You'll do fine, Doba-chan!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:50.660
All right. We've agreed on Dobashi-san for the 100 meter dash.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.620
How did it end up like this?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:06:00.080
Now that we've decided on the athletic competitors for the events,

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.710
Enomoto...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:06.010
We'll need one boy and one girl to be in charge of cheer leading on behalf of the class.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.090
Ah it's the annoying job.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.720
That's the only one I don't want to do.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.550
Yes, I nominate Enomoto-san as the girl!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:09.550
What?!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.850
Dobashi!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:14.100
You're good at bossing people around, after all.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.770
Plus, you nominated me for the 100 meter dash.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.350
This and that are completely different!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.480
Why do I have to be a cheerleader?

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.230
Plus, I can't draw.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.740
I'm in the art club, so I'll help you make banners.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.740
It'd be fun if all of us were cheerleaders.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.370
Cheerleaders?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.160
Who would make all the cheerleader outfits?!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.250
Kei-chan, weren't you in the arts and crafts club?

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.460
It'd be easy.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.170
It's a pain sewing new ones for everybody!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.170
Which one of you guys will do it?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.260
You do it.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.130
No way!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.840
Me! I'll be the guy cheerleader!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.930
None of you guys want to do it, so I guess I'll have to take initiative.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.560
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.560
I didn't want to do it either, but at this rate we can't wrap up, so...

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:06.980
How honorable. Kusuda-kun's volunteering because no one else will.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:12.450
He just reacted to the idea of cheerleaders.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:17.330
In any case, Kusuda-kun and Enomoto-san have been chosen for the cheerleading squad.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.750
So, let's give them a round of applause.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:27.340
Now that the athletes have been chosen, the rest is up to those of you on cleaning duty.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.180
Please start working after school.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.800
Okay!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.970
Gosh, you all better participate!

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.980
Chikura-chan, you're in charge of banners.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:42.980
Okay.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.020
Can you direct everyone on what to do?

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.270
Yeah, I got it.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.320
Everyone else will make megaphones for the class.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.440
Okay!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.740
See? I told you Enomoto's good at being in charge.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.620
She might disagree, but her leadership skills are strong.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.280
Kei-chan...

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.580
Looks can be deceiving, right?

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.580
Yeah!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.250
Hm?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.250
Do I have something on my face?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.580
Nope.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.550
Are you really going to do it?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.340
Do what?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.380
Cheerleading.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.930
Let's do it with everyone.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.550
Though it is a bit embarrassing...

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:17.390
Do we even have a reason to do it? Cheerleading, that is.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.220
Are you stupid?!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.220
Kusuda!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.230
Of course, you're all going to do it!

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:24.230
Cheering on the class will earn you points!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:26.480
We're going to use our power to win!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.070
Yes, yes, we understand.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.570
Now go away! You're being a bother.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.740
L-O-V-E~

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.660
Lovely Kusuda, yeah!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.120
Why the hell do you have to cheer?

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.540
Isn't the choreography good?!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.540
This is the worst.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.290
Working with someone like him in the cheerleading squad...

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.960
It really isn't my day.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.710
He even looks like a monster...

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:53.470
He's always thinking of perverted things too.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:58.470
He's the only person I wouldn't want to be seen by in my cheerleading outfit.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:02.980
School, sports, music, art. It doesn't matter what it is, he's not good at anything!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.850
Kei-chan, he can hear you!

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:05.520
Huh?

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.150
The voice of your heart.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.150
What?!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.480
Shut up!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:13.610
I don't even have the slightest interest in seeing you as a cheerleader!

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.160
What did you say?!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.450
Shut up, kappa-face!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.870
What's your problem? You're always so violent!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.080
You wrinkly-face!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.210
Stop right there, Kusuda!

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.460
Make me!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.120
Ah, just leave them alone.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.840
Gosh, I can't believe him!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:38.220
I wanted to work in peace, but because of that stupid Kusuda...

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:42.390
Ahh, cheerleading with him sucks!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.520
There, there.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.520
Sorry. My bad.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.520
It's not your fault.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.520
Enomoto...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:55.150
If he was just a bit better looking, I wouldn't get this pissed off even if he'd say those things!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:56.700
Huh?

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.660
That's why guys are all about looks!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.990
That moron with the social standing of a kappa...

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:04.080
How dare he piss me off!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.040
As long as you don't touch it, you won't be cursed.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:06.790
Yeah.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:07.870
I've decided!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:12.040
Starting tomorrow I won't listen to a thing he says, so if anything happens I'll leave it to you.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:16.300
Oh, sorry. I've got club meetings starting tomorrow so I can't help you.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.010
Just ditch it!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.430
But the tournament is coming up soon.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.640
We also...

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.810
have a competition soon.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.980
The choir too...

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.230
Why don't you ditch if you don't want to be around Kusuda that badly?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.020
Don't say something so ridiculous!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.190
If I ditch, then we won't be able to do any real cheering, will we?!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.240
I-I'll help you, okay, Kei-chan?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.990
Thank you, Chikura-chan.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.780
But designing banners is a different job...

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.750
This is blue right?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.670
Hey, can you get the yellow paint?

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.380
Lucky them... sounds like fun.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.210
On the other hand...

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.380
Hey.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.550
What?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.840
Shouldn't we think of lyrics for the fight song everyone's going to sing?

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:02.680
Yeah.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:05.390
Speaking of which, I wonder what he's been writing all this time...

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.390
Lyrics maybe?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.560
Although he did piss me off yesterday,

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:13.270
I did say some mean things to him yesterday, too.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.110
Maybe he's surprisingly reliable?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.400
Okay.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.070
Done!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.240
Really?

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.320
Let me see!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.530
Voila!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.280
Huh, what's that?

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:27.120
The cheerleading outfits that I designed!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.290
The key is that the upper half is a bikini-

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.250
I was wrong to think any better of you!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.170
And I'm not even drawn on here!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.420
What's with that?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.980
Umm...

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.310
Like I thought, this design is a bit...

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.980
We could catch a cold in this weather, so it's impossible.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.400
Is that the problem?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.530
For now, I need to think of a different design right away.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:11.910
There has never been anyone as strong as he was. After leading his men through many battles and wars...

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.000
I need to do something about this...

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:28.760
If I let that idiot help, nothing will work out!

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:34.140
Sewing room

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.560
Huh?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:35.190
What do you mean I don't have to do anything?

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.610
Like I said, you don't have to do anything!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.940
But we haven't decided on the lyrics yet.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.110
Even the outfits haven't been...

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:46.740
I'll do everything! Both the lyrics and the cheerleading outfits!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.120
No, I said I'd help you make the outfits.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:54.580
I don't want a pervert like you handing them, so get out!

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.960
From that day on, I worked with the engine on full throttle.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.930
Go Class 2! Fight Oh!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:11.350
Go Class 2! Fight Oh!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:10.180
On days that everyone else would help out, we would practice the choreography.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.940
The other days would be making outfits.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.940
However...

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.900
Ow!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.870
When will I finish all of them at this rate?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.630
Yamagishi.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.340
Here.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.920
Yamada.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:41.750
Here.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.380
Yukawa.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.630
I wonder what happened to Kei-chan?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.260
Here.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.260
Maybe she caught a cold?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.930
Even though tomorrow's the sports festival?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.300
Maybe she overslept?

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.430
Watanuki.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.060
Here.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.480
I'm sorry! I overslept.

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.390
O-Okay.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.560
Kei-chan!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:58.810
Morning!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.150
Morning!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.270
Morning.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.730
Morning.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.240
I'm glad you didn't catch a cold.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:06.700
A cold?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.280
Didn't get enough sleep?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.080
You've got bags under your eyes.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.080
You're kidding!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.750
My beautiful face...

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.540
Like I said, we'll help.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.000
It's okay. You have a competition coming up, right?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.250
I'll be fine.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.090
It's done!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:39.190
There's no way I can tell how good it looks until I try it on!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.540
I must say it's well done. Well done!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.000
And such with a nice body!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.880
It really was a good idea for me to go with this design.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.630
I might have the skill to be a designer!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.220
Okay!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.840
I'm going to work hard!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:36.330
I wish I hadn't been so determined on that appliqua for the chest...

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.910
I sew and sew, but I still won't finish in time.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.670
I'm getting kind of sleepy.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.590
Of course I would be.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.380
I'm even making outfits at home every night.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.390
It's impossible. I've reached my limit.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:59.890
I wanted to cheer everyone on perfectly, and let the whole class enjoy it.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.190
Everyone... I'm sorry.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.440
The outfits are really cute!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.530
Aren't they?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.160
As always, you have good taste, Enomoto.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.660
Thanks, Kei-chan!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:18.080
Thanks!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.120
It's amazing!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.630
I'm glad I worked so hard after hearing that from you guys!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:28.090
Well then, why don't we all cheer together?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:31.260
Go Class 2! Fight Oh!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.510
Go Class 2!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.140
It was a dream.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.690
K-Kusuda?!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.110
Dumbass.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.400
There was no way you could do it all by yourself.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.570
Why?

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.280
I told you I'd help.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.910
I learned to use the sewing machine in home economics at least.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:02.160
I'm letting you know now, I got a B in that class back then! A solid B!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.040
But...

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.920
I said all those horrible things to you!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.630
I'm part of the cheerleading squad too.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.880
Watching you work hard from the sidelines by yourself just isn't manly of me.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.470
No...

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.930
No. Why am I...

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:25.390
Someone with a kappa's face like yours isn't suddenly cool by saying something like that!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.230
Shut up!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.270
If you're awake then hurry up and start sewing!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:29.770
What the hell?

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.230
I can't believe it! I can't believe it! I can't believe it!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.780
It's all about looks with men. The face is the most important!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.240
Damn.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.000
There's no point if the outfits aren't done.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.040
Point?

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:48.710
We won't be able to worship Arihara or Bessho in these outfits.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:54.590
I still hate you after all!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.340
Oops.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.140
Kusuda?

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.930
Hey, get Up!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.390
What are you going to do about the outfits?!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.100
Kusuda!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:15.320
35th Sports Festival

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.820
Testing. Testing.

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.620
Mic testing.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:25.080
All students, please come to the grounds by 8:30.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.120
I repeat...

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:27.960
Um...

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:32.590
Enomoto, weren't you making cheerleader outfits?

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.550
I only managed to finish one set.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.170
Because of someone...

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.840
It's my fault?!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:39.970
It's yours!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.470
So that's why we have these?

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:48.440
Is that the one outfit that was finished?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.900
Yup.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:57.070
I figured we could put it to use differently...

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.860
I mean, no one is going to appreciate this...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:00.740
Right?

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.820
No, no. It suits you, Kusuda.

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.530
Should I take a commemorative picture?

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:08.460
Oh well, I'll be popular, so...

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:09.330
Now, then!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.630
Everyone, we're going to cheer them on with high spirits!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:15.920
Yeah!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:21.510
He's still going to cheer even when I made him dress like that...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.600
Maybe he is reliable after all.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.470
No, he's not reliable!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.430
Plus, I don't even want to rely on him!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.600
What am I thinking?!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.190
He's got a kappa's face!

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.810
I can't believe it! I can't believe it!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.940
First, the way to shake the pom-poms...

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.110
I borrowed this from Zaitsu-kun!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.280
I got this from Onii-chan!

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.530
That's just perverted.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.330
Who did you borrow yours from, Doba-chan?

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.200
It doesn't matter.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:54.670
The boy's uniforms on the girls is pretty exciting!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.210
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.510
Crap!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.670
Don't take pictures, you idiot!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.430
S-Stupid, don't come over here.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.600
Fine.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.390
You've got a perverted background picture.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.270
No I don't!

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.310
Then, show me, Kusuda!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.150
I'm telling you, you've got it all wrong!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.480
It started again.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.060
Let's just leave them alone. Leave them alone.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:26.120
The next event is the second year girls' 100 meter dash.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.580
On your mark!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.040
Go!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:32.870
Keep going!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:35.000
Yay, Doba-chan, you're so fast!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.210
You look so cool, Doba-chan!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:40.340
Yeah, looks like we're taking first for this race too!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.930
Wow, amazing!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.730
Dobashi's great, isn't she?

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.600
Only if she was jut a bit cuter...

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.270
Don't you think so, Terai?

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.270
Uh, yeah.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.160
Congrats, Doba-chan!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.790
You're way better than a lot of the other boys!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.380
Is that a compliment?

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.840
Okay!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.960
In commemoration of Dobashi's first place: a victory dance!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.300
Victory!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.430
Yes, victory!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:30.850
V for victory!

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:32.890
He's an idiot.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:34.810
Thanks for the cheering.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:37.100
It seems like you made outfits in time.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.520
Oh, Kusuda-

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.770
It's thanks to Enomoto working so hard!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:44.240
Thinking up the design, buying the material, and making the outfits...

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:47.780
She did it all by herself, so it's all thanks to her.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.830
Huh? Kei-chan, your face is all red.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.170
What happened?

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.330
Hey!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:01.040
Stop trying to act so cool even though you've got a kappa's face!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.210
Shut up! Wrinkly-face!

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.090
You shut up! Kappa-face!

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:07.880
It's all about faces with guys! Faces!

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:52.610
With daddy's work transfer, I thought that I could finally be alone with my beloved brother!

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:55.530
But my brother has someone else he likes!

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:59.330
Koyoi will never forgive whoever it is!
